# SilverCare Environment Variables Documentation
# Note: The app runs 100% locally out-of-the-box using LocalStorageAdapter.
# The variables below are for connecting the future Supabase cloud backend.

# Client-Side Public Supabase Config (Safe for browser):
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI...

# Web Push VAPID Public Key:
# VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=BLk4B...

# Server-Side Only Secrets (Never expose to client):
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
